      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC7514121::web::020::5_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial alloys may be as-cast or wrought.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial alloys may contain defects and nonuniform elemental distributions.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is addition of W, Ta, Cr, V, Mo, Nb, or Hf.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC7514121::web::020::5_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intended operating conditions are simultaneous high-temperature and irradiation exposure.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding the selected refractory elements will refine the grains.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding the selected refractory elements will produce solid-solution strengthening.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456733::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC6397024::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC7514121::web::020::5_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The added elements will stabilize the solid solution.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456733::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC6397024::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The added elements will reduce irradiation-induced defect formation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC10456733::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Solid-solution stabilization, defect suppression, and grain refinement will enhance high-temperature strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6397024::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC7514121::web::020::5_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Solid-solution stabilization, defect suppression, and grain refinement will enhance irradiation resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC10456733::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will increase yield strength at high temperature and under irradiation relative to alloys without the selected additions.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC6397024::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC7514121::web::020::5_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will increase ductility at high temperature and under irradiation relative to alloys without the selected additions.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will maintain thermal stability.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC6397024::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will maintain irradiation stability.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC10456733::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The mechanical improvement should be significant above 800 °C.",
      "field": "boundary",
